<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="mc-api-base" content=""><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Set up your front desk | Machines &amp; Cloud</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Create a secure workspace, save your business rules, and privately test website chat before activation.">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow"><meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
  <link rel="icon" href="assets/favicon.png">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
  <style>
    .ob { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 120px 20px 80px; }
    .ob h1 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 2.6rem); margin: 0 0 8px; }
    .ob .lead { color: #5B6273; margin: 0 0 28px; }
    .ob-steps { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin: 0 0 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .ob-steps span { font-size: 12px; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB; background: #fff; color: #5B6273; }
    .ob-steps span.on { background: #1E2433; color: #fff; border-color: #1E2433; }
    .ob fieldset { border: 1px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius: 20px; background: #fff; padding: 22px 22px 8px; margin: 0 0 18px; display: none; }
    .ob fieldset.on { display: block; }
    .ob legend { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #1E2433; padding: 0 6px; }
    .ob .hint { font-size: 13px; color: #5B6273; margin: -2px 0 14px; }
    .ob .row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; }
    @media (max-width: 600px) { .ob .row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    .ob .form-group { margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .ob textarea.form-input { min-height: 84px; resize: vertical; }
    .ob .plans-pick { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    @media (max-width: 600px) { .ob .plans-pick { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    .ob .plans-pick label { border: 1px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius: 14px; padding: 12px; cursor: pointer; display: block; }
    .ob .plans-pick input { margin-right: 6px; }
    .ob .plans-pick label.on { border-color: #2563EB; background: #EEF4FF; }
    .ob .nav { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; margin-top: 8px; }
    .ob .btn-pill { cursor: pointer; border: 0; }
    .ob .done { display: none; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius: 20px; background: #fff; padding: 26px; }
    .ob .done.on { display: block; }
    .ob .status { font-size: 14px; color: #5B6273; margin: 10px 0; }
    .ob code { background: #F3F4F6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 13px; }
    .ob .portal { word-break: break-all; }
    .ob .chk { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; margin: 8px 0; font-size: 14px; }
    [hidden] { display: none !important; }
    .access-card { padding: 24px; border: 1px solid #dbe3ef; border-radius: 16px; background: #fff; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .access-card h2 { margin: 0 0 10px; }
    .access-card p { color: #52627a; margin: 10px 0; line-height: 1.6; }
    .access-card .btn-pill { margin-top: 14px; min-height: 44px; }
    .access-signed-in { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 13px; }
    .access-signed-in button { background: none; border: 0; color: #2459df; padding: 10px; cursor: pointer; }
    .ob .connection-picks { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; margin: 10px 0; }
    .ob .connection-picks label { display: flex; gap: 9px; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid #dbe3ef; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; }
    .ob .connection-picks input { width: 17px; height: 17px; accent-color: #2459df; }
    .ob .setup-availability { padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f0f5ff; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #405879; }
    .ob .email-preference { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; margin: 8px 0; color: #40516c; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; cursor: pointer; }
    .ob .email-preference input { width: 17px; height: 17px; flex: 0 0 auto; margin-top: 3px; accent-color: #2459df; }
    .ob .intake-notice { padding: 12px 14px; border-left: 3px solid #2459df; background: #f0f5ff; color: #405879; line-height: 1.6; }
    @media (max-width: 420px) { .ob .connection-picks { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .hours-rows{display:grid;gap:6px;margin-top:8px}.hours-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:44px 1fr 24px 1fr;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px}.hours-row input{padding:8px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;border-radius:8px;font:inherit}
</style>
</head>
<body class="theme-light" data-no-widget>
<nav class="navbar scrolled" id="navbar"><div class="container"><div class="navbar-inner"><a class='navbar-logo' href='/'><img src="assets/logo-dark.png" alt="Machines & Cloud"></a></div></div></nav>
<main class="ob">
  <h1>Set up your front desk</h1>
  <p class="lead">Make it yours: your services, your schedule and the way you look after customers. We’ll guide you through each step.</p>
  <p id="intake-notice" class="intake-notice" role="status" hidden></p>
  <section id="access-gate" class="access-card" aria-labelledby="access-title">
    <h2 id="access-title">Save your place</h2><p id="access-intro">We’ll email you a secure sign-in link so you can save your answers and come back anytime. No password needed.</p>
    <form id="access-form"><label class="form-label" for="access-email">Work email</label><input class="form-input" id="access-email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required><button class="btn-pill btn-pill-blue" id="access-send" type="submit">Email me a sign-in link</button></form>
    <button class="btn-pill btn-pill-blue" id="access-verify" type="button" hidden>Continue securely</button><p id="access-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </section>
  <div id="access-signed-in" class="access-signed-in" hidden><span id="access-identity"></span><button type="button" id="access-sign-out">Sign out</button></div>
  <p id="draft-status" class="hint" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
  <div class="ob-steps" hidden><span class="on">1 Your front desk</span><span>2 Your business</span><span>3 Prices and schedule</span><span>4 Your preferences</span></div>
  <form id="ob" novalidate hidden>
    <p hidden><input name="botfield" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></p>
    <input type="hidden" id="primaryGoal" name="primaryGoal">
    <fieldset class="on" data-step="1"><legend>Your front desk</legend>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="name">Your name</label><input class="form-input" id="name" name="name" required autocomplete="name"></div>
        <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="email">Email</label><input class="form-input" id="email" name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" readonly></div>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="phone">Your contact cell</label><input class="form-input" id="phone" name="phone" required type="tel" placeholder="(713) 555 0100" autocomplete="tel"><span class="hint" style="display:block;margin-top:4px">The callback number you want saved with your business.</span></div>
        <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="website">Business website <span>(optional)</span></label><input class="form-input" id="website" name="website" type="url" placeholder="https://"><span class="hint" style="display:block;margin-top:4px">For reference. Next, you’ll add the answers your front desk should use.</span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="form-label" id="connection-preferences-label">Where would you like help?</p>
      <div class="connection-picks" role="group" aria-labelledby="connection-preferences-label"><label><input type="checkbox" name="desiredChannels" value="web" checked>Website inquiries</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="desiredChannels" value="voice">Phone calls</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="desiredChannels" value="sms">Text messages</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="desiredChannels" value="calendar">Calendar scheduling</label></div>
      <p class="setup-availability">You can prepare and test website chat now. Phone, text and calendar connections aren’t available yet. Your choices are saved in this setup; nothing is activated or charged here.</p>
      <p class="hint">Plan preference for later activation</p>
      <div class="plans-pick">
        <label><input type="radio" name="plan" value="starter"> <b>Coverage</b> $99/month</label>
        <label class="on"><input type="radio" name="plan" value="growth" checked> <b>Follow-through</b> $249/month</label>
      </div>
      <p id="plan-preference-note" class="hint" role="status" hidden></p>
      <p class="hint">Free to set up. No card required. You’ll review paid service terms before any subscription starts.</p>
      <p class="form-label" id="email-preference-label">Email updates <span>(optional)</span></p>
      <label class="email-preference" for="setup-marketing"><input type="checkbox" id="setup-marketing"><span>Email me practical tips, product updates and offers from Machines &amp; Cloud. Unsubscribe anytime.</span></label><p class="hint">You can finish setup either way. <a href='/privacy-policy'>Privacy Policy</a></p>
    </fieldset>
    <fieldset data-step="2"><legend>Your business</legend>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="business">Business name</label><input class="form-input" id="business" name="business" required></div>
        <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="trade">Trade</label><input class="form-input" id="trade" name="trade" placeholder="HVAC, plumbing, electrical, roofing, cleaning" list="trades"><datalist id="trades"><option>HVAC</option><option>Plumbing</option><option>Electrical</option><option>Roofing</option><option>Cleaning</option><option>Landscaping</option><option>Pest control</option><option>Garage doors</option><option>Handyman</option></datalist></div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="services">What you do (one per line)</label><textarea class="form-input" id="services" name="services" placeholder="AC repair&#10;AC replacement&#10;Maintenance plans"></textarea></div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="hours">Hours</label><input class="form-input" id="hours" name="hours" placeholder="Mon to Fri 7 to 6, Sat 8 to 2"><div id="hoursRows" class="hours-rows"></div><span class="hint">The rows fill in from what you type; fix any day that is off. The front desk uses these hours to explain when your shop is open and apply your after-hours rules.</span><input type="hidden" name="hoursTable" id="hoursTable"></div>
        <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="afterHours">After hours</label><input class="form-input" id="afterHours" name="afterHours" placeholder="Emergencies only, $150 fee"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="serviceArea">Service area (one per line or commas)</label><textarea class="form-input" id="serviceArea" name="serviceArea" placeholder="Katy, Cypress, Sugar Land"></textarea></div>
        <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="notServed">Not served</label><textarea class="form-input" id="notServed" name="notServed" placeholder="Inside the Loop, The Woodlands"></textarea></div>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="city">City</label><input class="form-input" id="city" name="city" value="Houston"></div>
        <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="spanish">Answer in Spanish too?</label><select class="form-input" id="spanish" name="spanish"><option value="yes">Yes</option><option value="no">No</option></select></div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="licenses">License numbers (optional)</label><input class="form-input" id="licenses" name="licenses" placeholder="TACLA 12345C, TECL 1234"></div>
    </fieldset>
    <fieldset data-step="3"><legend>Prices and arrival windows</legend>
      <p class="hint">The front desk only ever quotes what you list here. Everything else it says the tech confirms on site.</p>
      <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="fees">Published prices (one per line: what: amount (note))</label><textarea class="form-input" id="fees" name="fees" placeholder="Diagnostic visit: $89 (applied to the repair)&#10;After-hours fee: $150&#10;Drain clearing: from $149"></textarea></div>
      <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="windows">Arrival windows you offer (one per line)</label><textarea class="form-input" id="windows" name="windows" placeholder="8 to 12&#10;12 to 5"></textarea></div>
      <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="faq">Questions customers ask, with your answer (one per line: Question? Answer)</label><textarea class="form-input" id="faq" name="faq" placeholder="Do you charge a service call fee? $89, waived if you go ahead with the repair.&#10;Are you licensed and insured? Yes, TACLA 12345C."></textarea></div>
    </fieldset>
    <fieldset data-step="4"><legend>Your preferences</legend>
      <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="handoff">Always hand these to a person (one per line)</label><textarea class="form-input" id="handoff" name="handoff" placeholder="Complaints about past work&#10;Warranty questions&#10;Commercial jobs"></textarea></div>
      <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="never">Never do (one per line; the basics are already in)</label><textarea class="form-input" id="never" name="never" placeholder="Never quote a replacement price&#10;No window units"></textarea></div>
      <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="tier0">Emergencies, tier 0: life safety (one per line; prefilled for your trade, edit freely)</label><textarea class="form-input" id="tier0" name="tier0"></textarea><span class="hint">The front desk gives your safety script and collects a phone number and address for an urgent request in your workspace. Phone and text alerts are not active.</span></div>
      <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="tier1">Emergencies, tier 1: same day (one per line)</label><textarea class="form-input" id="tier1" name="tier1"></textarea><span class="hint">These requests need urgent review in your workspace; a same-day visit or callback is not guaranteed. With an infant, elderly, or medically dependent person in the home, your safety rules take priority.</span></div>
      <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="emergencies">Your safety script, in your words</label><textarea class="form-input" id="emergencies" name="emergencies" placeholder="Gas smell: leave the house, call CenterPoint or 911, then us."></textarea></div>
      <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="notes">Anything else a new receptionist should know</label><textarea class="form-input" id="notes" name="notes" placeholder="We are a family shop, 12 years in Katy. Say 'Ray or one of the guys' not 'a technician'."></textarea></div>
      <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="greeting">First line of the website chat (optional)</label><input class="form-input" id="greeting" name="greeting" placeholder="Hi, this is the Bayou Air front desk. What can we help with today?"></div>
    </fieldset>
    <div class="nav"><button type="button" class="btn-pill btn-pill-dark" id="back" style="visibility:hidden">Back</button><button type="button" class="btn-pill btn-pill-blue" id="next">Next</button></div>
    <p class="form-status" id="err" role="alert"></p>
  </form>
  <section class="done" id="done">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0">Building your front desk</h2>
    <p class="status" id="buildStatus">Your answers are saved. Preparing your front desk.</p>
    <p><b>Your workspace</b> (you can sign in again with your email):<br><a class="portal" id="portalLink" href="#"></a></p>
    <p class="status">Your answers and connection preferences are together in one workspace. Follow your checklist to review, test and get ready for customer inquiries.</p>
    <p><a class="btn-pill btn-pill-blue" id="goPortal" href="#">Open my workspace</a></p>
  </section>
</main>
<script src="onboard.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
